caption:
  - "Happy Labor Day Weekend! Terry Booker and Dalton Watkins are opening The Cafe back up to the public as an order-and-go restaurant. Seating is available (no table service)"
  - "Standby as we finish adjusting the menu this month. Some favorite menu items return and we try out some new items. We are going to stick to a Deli style menu (no fried foods). Limited beverage options available."
  - "To contact us about catering options and events email us at theabcafe@gmail.com"
  - "Follow our facebook page to keep up to date on specials and any changes!"
  - "The Cafe has served Leavenworth County since 2005. We went private to serve meals on wheels alongside the council on aging in 2015 and focus on the catering side. We have served the Lansing Lions and Rotary alongside the various events at the Leavenworth Community Center."
